of the Kimberley. There were a lot of tourists around at that time of year, making it easier for the killer to blend in, and giving him more people to attack. In Australia, each police jurisdiction has a special operations group or tactical response group, TRG. These are specialist teams that respond to high risk situations such as sieges, counter terrorism operations and other armed offender incidents. On June 16th, seven officers from the Western Australian TRG and an officer from the forensic

